<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>Shipment Assigned</title>
</head>

<body
  style="
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    background:#f4f7fb;
    font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
  "
>
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
<tr>
<td align="center">

<table
width="650"
cellpadding="0"
cellspacing="0"
style="
background:#ffffff;
margin:30px auto;
border-radius:12px;
overflow:hidden;
border:1px solid #e5e7eb;
">

<tr>
<td
style="
background:#8751e4;
color:#ffffff;
padding:32px;
text-align:center;
border-bottom:5px solid #6d3fd4;
">

<h1
style="
margin:0;
font-size:28px;
font-weight:700;
letter-spacing:1px;
">

SHIPMENT ASSIGNED

</h1>

</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td style="padding:35px;">

<h2 style="margin-top:0;">
Congratulations <%= transporterName %>!
</h2>

<p style="line-height:1.7;">
Your quotation has been selected by the administrator.
You have been assigned this shipment for transportation.
</p>

<table
width="100%"
cellpadding="10"
cellspacing="0"
style="
margin:25px 0;
border-collapse:collapse;
border:1px solid #ddd;
">

<tr>
<td><strong>Shipment ID</strong></td>
<td><%= shipmentInvoiceId %></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td><strong>Order ID</strong></td>
<td><%= orderId %></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td><strong>Product</strong></td>
<td><%= productName %></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td><strong>Pickup Location</strong></td>
<td><%= shipmentFrom %></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td><strong>Delivery Location</strong></td>
<td><%= shipmentTo %></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td><strong>Approved Transport Price</strong></td>
<td>
₹ <%= quotedPrice %>
</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td><strong>Estimated Delivery</strong></td>
<td>
<%= estimatedDeliveryDays %> Day(s)
</td>
</tr>

</table>

<div
style="
background:#eef9f1;
border-left:5px solid #198754;
padding:18px;
border-radius:8px;
">

<strong>Next Step</strong>

<p style="margin-bottom:0;line-height:1.8;">

Please arrange the pickup of the shipment from the seller's location
and transport it safely to the buyer's delivery address.

After the shipment is dispatched, keep the shipment status updated in
your dashboard until the delivery is completed successfully.


</p>

</div>

<div
style="
margin-top:35px;
text-align:center;
">

<a
href="<%= frontendUrl %>/transporter-assigned-shipments"
style="
background:#198754;
color:white;
text-decoration:none;
padding:14px 28px;
border-radius:8px;
display:inline-block;
font-weight:bold;
">

View Assignment

</a>

</div>

</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td
style="
background:#f3f4f6;
padding:25px;
text-align:center;
color:#666;
font-size:14px;
">

© <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Rubber Scrap Mart

<br><br>

This is an automated notification.

</td>
</tr>

</table>

</td>
</tr>
</table>

</body>
</html>